Hypothesis Hch1 : forall Θ, Θ 0%nat = ev E0 0%nat -> chainT stof Θ M00 midP1 G.
Hypothesis Hch2 : forall Θ, Θ 0%nat = ev E0 0%nat -> chainT2 stof Θ M00 midP2 1856 G.
Hypothesis Hsp1 : fr_sp f1 = A + 1856.
Hypothesis Hret : ltac2:(zQ "70!h4!l6!it7!tf!lm2!lr0!is4@3$0$2@2$6@1$1#k0@2$3?2E0No4@1$4@1$5?2f1").
